<section class="garden-index" aria-labelledby="connected-notebook">
<p class="garden-index__eyebrow">The Garden</p>
<h2 id="connected-notebook">A connected notebook</h2>
<p>The Garden is the public notebook connected to the newsletter: a small, growing collection that follows ideas from an issue into explainers, reading paths, and broader topic indexes.</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Evergreens</strong> are focused explanations of ideas that recur across issues.</li>
  <li><strong>Groves</strong> are guided reading paths through related notes, issues, and sources.</li>
  <li><strong>Forests</strong> are broad indexes that will gather published work around a topic.</li>
</ul>
<p>Only a small part is public so far. <a href="/evergreens/">Browse the published Evergreens</a> or <a href="/start-here/">read the guide to the site</a>.</p>
</section>
{% if collections.recentGardenUpdates | length %}
<section class="garden-index" aria-labelledby="recent-garden-updates">
<p class="garden-index__eyebrow">Growing now</p>
<h2 id="recent-garden-updates">Recent updates to the garden</h2>
<ol class="recent-list">
{%- for note in collections.recentGardenUpdates -%}
  <li>
    <span class="recent-list__number">{{ note.data.gardenType }}</span>
    <a href="{{ note.url }}">{% if note.data.title %}{{ note.data.title }}{% else %}{{ note.fileSlug }}{% endif %}</a>
  </li>
{%- endfor -%}
</ol>
</section>
{% endif %}
